        "note_tweet": {
          "entities": {},
          "text": "In the aftermath of 9/11, Steve Buscemi returned to his old fire station, where he had served as a firefighter in the early 1980s. \n\nDonning his old uniform, he worked 12 hour shifts for days on end, searching for survivors in the rubble of the World Trade Center. \n\nHe did so without media attention, a quiet act of courage that later became a powerful symbol of solidarity."
